    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and fight on a journey of revenge. Play as Sal, a fearless member of the Night Wolves, determined to find Skarlet, who has apparently been kidnapped by the ruthless biker gang, the Scorpions. Punch your way through 8 challenging worlds, facing relentless enemies, deadly traps, and hidden dangers. Only your skill and determination will lead you to the truth in this intense classic arcade action adventure.</p>",
